(7398130, 1163991, 30982, '<td valign="top">The vignetting sorta takes away from a "snapshot" feel (most shapshooters don''t bother with post processing of any kind) but the centered subject is kinda snapshottish!</td>', 'The vignetting sorta takes away from a "snapshot" feel (most shapshooters don''t bother with post processing of any kind) but the centered subject is kinda snapshottish!', '2015-08-17 23:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
