(7398136, 1163919, 30982, '<td valign="top">My only nit as far as a "snapshot" goes is the odd aspect ratio, though I do realize many point and shoots (and phones for that matter) have incorporated these types of shots.  Lovely silhouettes, nice interplay between the characters.</td>', 'My only nit as far as a "snapshot" goes is the odd aspect ratio, though I do realize many point and shoots (and phones for that matter) have incorporated these types of shots.  Lovely silhouettes, nice interplay between the characters.', '2015-08-17 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7398139, 1164119, 352, '<td valign="top">Too blurry; could use better DOF.</td>', 'Too blurry; could use better DOF.', '2015-08-17 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7398140, 1164082, 114285, '<td valign="top">The look on the kids face says it all...why bother taking your child out that''s if it is her child on a date when your just going to spend time on your phone,  it''s one of my pet gripes of today''s society,  and people wonder why children are depressed these days!!!  Good find by the way  on a sad and true commentary of life these days,  and one that we see all too often!</td>', 'The look on the kids face says it all...why bother taking your child out that''s if it is her child on a date when your just going to spend time on your phone,  it''s one of my pet gripes of today''s society,  and people wonder why children are depressed these days!!!  Good find by the way  on a sad and true commentary of life these days,  and one that we see all too often!', '2015-08-17 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
