(7399450, 1164146, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''m awarding <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif"/></a> Brunette Pigtails to this entry. I like the different processing, the centered image, especially the open door, the lady on the phone and the guy sitting there with nothing to do and no one to talk to. The scene is almost that of a camping cabin that I remember from childhood, but with the fancy pillars one might find on a grand home. Just a very nice collection of contradictions.</td>', 'I''m awarding  Brunette Pigtails to this entry. I like the different processing, the centered image, especially the open door, the lady on the phone and the guy sitting there with nothing to do and no one to talk to. The scene is almost that of a camping cabin that I remember from childhood, but with the fancy pillars one might find on a grand home. Just a very nice collection of contradictions.', '2015-08-23 23:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
